00:27:12.000 --> 00:27:45.000
the strong cities network of which American cities, several American cities are also members, to promote this kind of community effort. It's not without its problems. Sometimes some communities feel targeted and victimized by these programs. need to keep searching for ways of addressing the problems as a society in its entirety. Psychologists can be very helpful because I think that we understand the roots of the problem.
即“强大城市网络”（Strong Cities Network），美国的一些城市也是其成员，旨在促进这种社区努力。它并非没有问题。有时一些社区觉得被这些项目针对和受害。需要不断寻找以整个社会来解决问题的方法。心理学家可以非常有帮助，因为我认为我们了解问题的根源。

42
00:27:45.000 --> 00:28:36.000
